 extensions, largely with convict labor). This gave a connection toward Morristown and Knoxville. Frequency estimated, unsourced.", "sources": ["NOT SOURCED AT SEGMENT LEVEL: the references below cover this line, but nothing has been checked specifically against this segment's start year, end year or service. Treat the dates and the headway as unverified. Supporting references for the line:"]}, {"start": 1894, "end": 1971, "headway_min": 480, "note": "Conveyed to the Southern Railway Aug 22 1894 along with the rest of the WNCRR system. Frequency estimated, unsourced.", "sources": ["NOT SOURCED AT SEGMENT LEVEL: the references below cover this line, but nothing has been checked specifically against this segment's start year, end year or service. Treat the dates and the headway as unverified. Supporting references for the line:"]}, {"start": 1971, "end": 1979, "headway_min": 720, "note": "Southern Railway kept running its own (non-Amtrak) intercity trains until 1979; frequency estimated, unsourced.", "sources": ["NOT SOURCED AT SEGMENT LEVEL: the references below cover this line, but nothing has been checked specifically against this segment's start year, end year or service. Treat the dates and the headway as unverified. Supporting references for the line:"]}]}, "geometry": {"type": "LineString", "coordinates": [[-82.56684, 35.58607], [-82.57118, 35.59182], [-82.57476, 35.59431], [-82.57654, 35.59721], [-82.57688, 35.60014], [-82.58098, 35.60556], [-82.58093, 35.60735], [-82.57876, 35.61022], [-82.57752, 35.61446], [-82.57893, 35.61866], [-82.58131, 35.62286], [-82.58396, 35.62437], [-82.58662, 35.62468], [-82.59308, 35.62254], [-82.59825, 35.62248], [-82.60052, 35.6232], [-82.60253, 35.62511], [-82.60309, 35.6292], [-82.6016, 35.63245], [-82.60098, 35.63628], [-82.59982, 35.63934], [-82.60084, 35.64342], [-82.60132, 35.64952], [-82.60344, 35.65523], [-82.6047, 35.6563], [-82.60708, 35.65682], [-82.61698, 35.65714], [-82.61999, 35.65884], [-82.62341, 35.6599], [-82.6